local-first Microsoft 365 mirror for SQLite  |  doctor

DOCTOR
======

Ready checks
------------
  ● teams_installed    Teams data found at <teams-root>
  ● full_disk_access   the Teams container is readable
  ● teams_origin       1 Teams origin(s) found
  ● database_writable  <db> is writable
  ● schema_version     schema v6
  ● fts                full-text indexes present
  ● archive_newer      the archive was written by this or an older m365crawl (derivation version 2)
  ● last_sync_status   the last sync was ok
  ● last_sync_age      last successful sync <age> ago
  ▲ calendar_cache     the Teams calendar cache was last fresh <age> ago
                       fix: Open the Teams calendar once so Teams caches it, then run `m365crawl sync`.
  ● outlook_store      the Outlook source is off (--outlook-root none, or --teams-root without --outlook-root); name --outlook-root DIR to turn it on
  ● mail_readable      mail is not read: the Outlook source is off (--outlook-root none, or --teams-root without --outlook-root)
  ● mail_archive_mode  the archive is readable by its owner only (0600)

